  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 17.3% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $2.92B (17.3% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tradfi-and-fintech/the-amc-fight-turned-into-an-industry-argument-over-which-tokenized-stock-model-wins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The AMC Fight Turned Into An Industry Argument Over Which Tokenized Stock Model Wins</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tokens/money-mushroom-moved-a-nasdaq-penny-stock-but-its-tokenized-stock-is-a-memecoin-too\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&#x27;Money Mushroom&#x27; Moved A Nasdaq Penny Stock, But Its &#x27;Tokenized Stock&#x27; Is A Memecoin Too</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-brings-defi-yield-to-tokenized-stocks-and-etfs?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kraken brings DeFi yield to tokenized stocks and ETFs</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-09-15-this-one-stings-clarity-act-fails-senate-is-cryptos-biggest-regulatory-push-dead-415135\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\u2018This one stings\u2019: Clarity Act fails procedural Senate vote \u2014 is crypto\u2019s biggest regulatory push dead?</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
